        "title": "The table and pie chart give information about the population in Australia according to different nationalities and areas. Summarize the key information by highlighting the main features and make appropriate comparisons. ",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QckDdpNk1onYz3xfS2Al6rWCgKc\"><em><strong>The table and pie chart give information about the population in Australia according to different nationalities and areas.</strong></em><em><strong> Summarize the key information by highlighting the main features and </strong></em><em><strong>make</strong></em><em><strong> appropriate comparisons.</strong></em><em><strong> </strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Australian Population by Nationality and Area</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqPldEHP5oO9Eqxr2kRlefpxgtb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XqItdByFCopoQfxNSMplwkrkgrb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p>Đề b&agrave;i Australian Population by Nationality and Area cho 2 charts, y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về:</p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PBeMd9YNAomZqRxBFCalH6gWgfh\"><strong>[Pie Chart]</strong> sự ph&acirc;n bổ d&acirc;n số ở Australia dựa tr&ecirc;n c&aacute;c quốc tịch kh&aacute;c nhau</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CHF8dwYjGo15KIxmbg0lQVUrgmh\"><strong>[Table] </strong>tỷ lệ phần trăm cư d&acirc;n sống ở khu vực th&agrave;nh thị v&agrave; n&ocirc;ng th&ocirc;n</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KJIDd23oMoldbUxAfnilBuFRgNd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong>&nbsp;</strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SR9ZdYWR1o7uhYxz4tklkj5Egmz\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Australian Population by Nationality and Area với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KAxXdQN0ooarjBxF0x2lfcCdgAO\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>[Pie Chart]:</strong> sự ph&acirc;n bổ d&acirc;n số ở Australia - dựa tr&ecirc;n c&aacute;c quốc tịch kh&aacute;c nhau</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SRrBdMnNloIB07xeRgrl6gmjgBg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>[Table]: </strong>tỷ lệ phần trăm cư d&acirc;n - sống ở khu vực th&agrave;nh thị v&agrave; n&ocirc;ng th&ocirc;n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NYwkd1jG3ojREPxVYXKlUhzvgze\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng Mixed Charts, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kuf3d2oh2ocnJvxpLZjlWhwegtc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>[Pie Chart]:</strong> người c&oacute; quốc tịch &Uacute;c l&agrave; nh&oacute;m chiếm đa số trong to&agrave;n quốc</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M9AHdzJZyofmY9xnvpPl7hBSgTf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>[Table]: </strong>phần lớn d&acirc;n số sống ở th&agrave;nh phố, đặc biệt l&agrave; người nhập cư Trung Quốc hầu hết đều ở khu vực đ&ocirc; thị</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch chia mỗi BODY tương ứng với 1 chart:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IVPxdrYypohRjbxFqFTlbGXjgJf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Pie Chart - sự ph&acirc;n bổ d&acirc;n số ở Australia dựa tr&ecirc;n c&aacute;c quốc tịch kh&aacute;c nhau</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VguVdTvpNoqSWIxEeOLlUSIig4P\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TyHMdnYjvoaQohx7c5Ul9LM9gZd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu của người quốc tịch Australian v&agrave; quốc tịch British </strong><em>(73% vs 7%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jo8BdWo9HoNLmvxxzAXlQQxrgje\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu của c&aacute;c nh&oacute;m c&ograve;n lại </strong><em>(New Zealanders l&agrave; 3%, Chinese l&agrave; 2%, Dutch l&agrave; 1% and other nationalities l&agrave; 15%)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BNxmdbwh6ooxrxxJhiIl92Cagsb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2:</strong><strong> Table - tỷ lệ phần trăm cư d&acirc;n sống ở khu vực th&agrave;nh thị v&agrave; n&ocirc;ng th&ocirc;n</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ExlvdbaM5o5dOxxzFYElZGEogOg\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QNKydDOIYoQr28xwrtmlDu5pgDb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu của người quốc tịch Chinese </strong><em>(hầu hết - 99% - đều sống ở th&agrave;nh phố)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XVLhd2eAZokMzaxaBedlEHnOgvf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu của người quốc tịch British v&agrave; New Zealander </strong><em>(phần lớn sống ở th&agrave;nh phố - lần lượt l&agrave; 89% v&agrave; 90%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BkBRdIQevoCHSMxHvQUl1JvxgXc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu của người quốc tịch Dutch v&agrave; Australian </strong><em>(83% người Dutch sống ở th&agrave;nh phố, cao hơn 3% so với người gốc Australian)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOGCdDfzMo4b0vxNcTDlMZwkgW6\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bc2gdrij0o2chcxcadllSjTsgke\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XdYcdsZ6Uo6tuXxGPs3lNnJUgHh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HE29dhmJjod0qix8V1qlgw9gggc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LeeTdsLFfomS2nxcCawlPKlogDb\">Khi muốn diễn đạt \"<strong>quốc tịch\"</strong>, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng c&aacute;c cụm sau để đa dạng c&acirc;u từ của m&igrave;nh hơn nh&eacute;:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YW7udbxFcob8rCxpK7RlPyzxgff\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(come/ originate) from <strong>[t&ecirc;n nước]</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Aqg4diO55ogkPzxqB3oloJ1ggJd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>identify as <strong>[quốc tịch]</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WRo3ddHSNoQZkvxuo4llxvUugob\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QesNdY2oBoUk1RxXBG1lOCsGgTe\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AgbqdcMKDoGEikxFDZDly0Gxgkb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>83% of people <strong>originating from the Netherlands</strong> have settled and remained in the city.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ItEFdWxxiop8SExzpUPlj9SrgKe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Nearly three quarters (73%) of the population <strong>identify as Australian.</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZD6tdIMdCoiL2cxB0EqlkTEPgnf\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
